abstract: "A reusable analysis framework and writing style tool based on Joseph Schumpeter's public methodology, including Creative Destruction, Entrepreneur as Innovator, Five Types of Innovation, Innovation Clusters and Long Waves, Evolutionary Economics, and the Capitalism-Socialism-Democracy thesis. Designed to assist in analyzing technological innovation, industrial disruption, corporate rise and fall, and capitalist evolution. This skill provides a thinking framework and writing style calibration, and does NOT claim to represent Joseph Schumpeter personally or his unpublished views."
